{"page":405,"verses":[{"verse_key":"30:6","surah":30,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"وَعْدَ ٱللَّهِ ۖ لَا يُخْلِفُ ٱللَّهُ وَعْدَهُۥ وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَ ٱلنَّاسِ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"This is God’s promise: God never breaks His promise, but most people do not know;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَعْدَ","en_gloss":"(It is the) Promise","transliteration":"waʿda","verse_key":"30:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"30:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"30:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُخْلِفُ","en_gloss":"fail","transliteration":"yukh'lifu","verse_key":"30:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"30:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَعْدَهُۥ","en_gloss":"(in) His promise","transliteration":"waʿdahu","verse_key":"30:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"30:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَكْثَرَ","en_gloss":"most (of)","transliteration":"akthara","verse_key":"30:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"[the] people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"30:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"30:6"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"30:6"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٦","en_gloss":"(6)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:6"}]},{"verse_key":"30:7","surah":30,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ ظَـٰهِرًا مِّنَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَهُمْ عَنِ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ هُمْ غَـٰفِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they only know the outer surface of this present life and are heedless of the life to come.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"They know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"30:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ظَـٰهِرًۭا","en_gloss":"(the) apparent","transliteration":"ẓāhiran","verse_key":"30:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"30:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱل